    "text": "Texas\nHow Hot Will It Feel in Your Texas Town This Weekend?\nBy pooks,\n9 hours agoThese Texas Towns Will Feel the Hottest This Weekend. It’s that time of year when the pavement could double as a frying pan. Even by Texas standards, this weekend is shaping up to be a sweaty one, and some towns are already topping the charts for the highest heat index in the state. Here’s a look at which places will feel the hottest across Texas and what’s behind the heat.",
